<title>USA: NYSE Unavailable - SGS-Thomson.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailable - SGS-Thomson.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that SGS-Thomson was unavailable for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>In addition, the exchange said Corimon SACA, SGL Carbon AG and Buenos Aires Embotelladora were also unavailable for after hours trading.</p>
